## ⚠️ Troubleshooting

> [!WARNING]
> **Aggressive Twitching:** Usually caused by a **Kp** value that is too high or sensor noise. Lower Kp or increase Kd slightly.

> [!CAUTION]
> **Slow Descent/Ascent:** If the drone takes too long to reach altitude, increase Kp. If it never reaches the target, increase Ki.

